# Rules
1. Never push to the default branch (push only your `fm/role-launch-scaffold-direct-PR` branch). Never merge a PR. Never push a `preserve/`, `archive/`, or `work/*-baseline` safety ref to any remote unless the task needs it there; keep it local.
